# Where the contact form posts inquiries (JSON). Any endpoint that returns a
# 2xx on success works, for example a Formspree form:
#   VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill it in. Without it the form shows its
# error state and points people to email instead of faking a success.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
